    GlobalTheory.CuspDecay.measure_lt_top GlobalTheory.Mem.VolFin.finVol _ _ _ hν h𝓕
  refine ⟨d, C₀ * ((G.mP (i + 1)).ν (G.mP (i + 1)).fd).toNNReal, fun ψ ha hk hs hg hc => ?_⟩
